# This file should contain the CA certificate for CMS demos.
# 
# To generate this file, run:
#   ./setup.sh
# 
# This will create a test CA certificate that can be used with the
# CMS demonstration programs. The certificate is public information
# but should be regenerated locally rather than using a committed version.
#
# For reference, the original test CA had:
#   Subject: C=UK, L=Test City, O=OpenSSL Group, CN=Test S/MIME Root CA
#
# DO NOT use this file in production. These are for testing/demonstration only.
